1
00:00:21,544 --> 00:00:24,310
[Night falls]

2
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:30,093
[An abandoned factory swallowed in darkness]

3
00:00:32,765 --> 00:00:35,366
[Hazardous material warning]

4
00:00:35,367 --> 00:00:37,261
[Restricted access]

5
00:00:40,327 --> 00:00:42,574
Ah... this is scary.

6
00:00:43,064 --> 00:00:45,849
Wow, I’m suddenly sweating so much.

7
00:00:46,435 --> 00:00:49,113
I hope we all make it out alive.

8
00:00:50,111 --> 00:00:51,275
Try hiding well.

9
00:00:51,276 --> 00:00:52,858
Let’s survive and see each other again.

10
00:00:53,477 --> 00:00:55,301
Huh? YEONJUN, someone’s over there.

11
00:00:55,974 --> 00:00:58,617
Are you... the seeker?

12
00:00:59,746 --> 00:01:03,771
[This place is off-limits]

13
00:01:04,888 --> 00:01:10,929
[Someone is definitely here]

14
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:14,125
Oh, that scared me.

15
00:01:16,559 --> 00:01:18,292
Wait, this isn’t right.

16
00:01:24,414 --> 00:01:25,921
I need to hide.

17
00:01:25,922 --> 00:01:27,418
It’s hide-and-seek, after all.

18
00:01:28,876 --> 00:01:34,139
Hide

19
00:01:34,140 --> 00:01:35,981
Avoid

20
00:01:35,982 --> 00:01:39,918
And run

21
00:01:41,491 --> 00:01:43,686
Ah, not here again.

22
00:01:44,867 --> 00:01:48,412
[You can’t escape]

23
00:01:56,341 --> 00:01:58,884
Actually, I already saw the seeker.

24
00:01:59,217 --> 00:02:00,928
What does the seeker look like?

25
00:02:05,403 --> 00:02:08,178
I’m in enemy territory right now.

26
00:02:19,498 --> 00:02:21,511
Ah, it’s so dark.

27
00:02:23,841 --> 00:02:25,838
I can’t see anything.

28
00:02:33,154 --> 00:02:35,324
What am I supposed to do here?

29
00:02:40,353 --> 00:02:43,115
Ah... this is insane.

30
00:02:44,473 --> 00:02:47,078
I’m seriously going crazy.

31
00:02:50,708 --> 00:02:52,385
Should I just leave?

32
00:03:00,783 --> 00:03:03,866
Wow, this is driving me nuts.

33
00:03:05,261 --> 00:03:09,097
[TOMORROW X TOGETHER awaken in darkness]

34
00:03:37,817 --> 00:03:39,870
Is this a clue too?

35
00:03:44,607 --> 00:03:46,808
Should I just start moving?

36
00:03:48,291 --> 00:03:49,598
[B1 / TAEHYUN]

37
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:51,400
[1F / HUENINGKAI / YEONJUN]

38
00:03:51,401 --> 00:03:52,938
[3F / SOOBIN]

39
00:03:52,939 --> 00:03:54,456
[4F / BEOMGYU]

40
00:03:54,457 --> 00:03:58,237
[3F / SOOBIN]

41
00:04:06,824 --> 00:04:09,037
Where am I going?

42
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,563
Do I just move around?

43
00:04:15,963 --> 00:04:20,291
[3F / SOOBIN]

44
00:04:21,027 --> 00:04:22,924
Wow, it’s way too dark.

45
00:04:25,218 --> 00:04:28,353
[Suspicious object outside the window]

46
00:04:33,874 --> 00:04:35,574
[Sound of something dropping]

47
00:04:36,186 --> 00:04:39,566
[An eerie atmosphere surrounds SOOBIN]

48
00:04:41,018 --> 00:04:42,367
Mission.

49
00:04:42,368 --> 00:04:44,032
Are we not getting a mission?

50
00:04:52,019 --> 00:04:55,778
[While waiting for instructions, he searches the area]

51
00:04:59,056 --> 00:05:01,970
[BEOMGYU appears holding a wig]

52
00:05:03,173 --> 00:05:05,825
[BEOMGYU wakes up on the 4th floor]

53
00:05:21,128 --> 00:05:23,175
[Notices something falling from the ceiling]

54
00:05:25,223 --> 00:05:27,188
What is this?

55
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:32,639
[And just like that, he picks up a wig]

56
00:05:36,245 --> 00:05:37,542
Huh?

57
00:05:38,819 --> 00:05:41,366
Did I already find something?

58
00:05:41,737 --> 00:05:43,052
What are we supposed to find?

59
00:05:43,053 --> 00:05:46,193
[SOOBIN finds the first key]

60
00:05:48,569 --> 00:05:50,390
YEONJUN, were you born here?

61
00:05:50,391 --> 00:05:52,042
I was just looking for a clue

62
00:05:52,043 --> 00:05:53,563
and found a key.

63
00:05:56,277 --> 00:05:57,102
What are we supposed to do?

64
00:05:57,103 --> 00:05:58,529
You haven’t gotten a message yet either, right?

65
00:05:59,576 --> 00:06:00,966
A message?

66
00:06:00,967 --> 00:06:03,425
I think we’ll get instructions by text.

67
00:06:04,181 --> 00:06:06,043
Wow, it’s been ages since I used this phone.

68
00:06:06,044 --> 00:06:08,190
But it’s so dark I can’t see anything.

69
00:06:08,191 --> 00:06:09,663
The light makes it even harder to see.

70
00:06:11,428 --> 00:06:12,565
Oh, that scared me.

71
00:06:15,087 --> 00:06:16,091
Oh man!

72
00:06:19,698 --> 00:06:21,042
Huh? YEONJUN, someone’s over there.

73
00:06:21,043 --> 00:06:21,888
Yeah, I saw them.

74
00:06:21,889 --> 00:06:23,325
That’s why I’m not going that way.

75
00:06:23,326 --> 00:06:24,798
I saw them as soon as I got here

76
00:06:24,799 --> 00:06:26,041
and just pretended I didn’t.

77
00:06:26,922 --> 00:06:27,902
What is that?

78
00:06:29,931 --> 00:06:32,185
[Sound of window opening]

79
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,469
Balloon.

80
00:06:44,249 --> 00:06:45,023
Can’t we lay that balloon down?

81
00:06:45,024 --> 00:06:46,681
That gives me such a bad feeling.

82
00:06:46,682 --> 00:06:48,231
Want me to move it?

83
00:06:49,106 --> 00:06:51,130
Lay it down! So we don’t see it!

84
00:06:54,211 --> 00:06:56,688
Looks a little less creepy now, right?

85
00:06:57,510 --> 00:06:58,174
Let’s go!

86
00:06:58,175 --> 00:06:59,379
I know they probably set it up on purpose

87
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:01,767
but I really can’t handle scary stuff.

88
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:04,748
[1F / YEONJUN]

89
00:07:04,749 --> 00:07:07,794
[Another one who can’t handle horror]

90
00:07:07,795 --> 00:07:09,500
What was that?

91
00:07:09,998 --> 00:07:12,558
[YEONJUN]
I think I’m doomed... ah...

92
00:07:17,987 --> 00:07:19,619
Where’s the mission?

93
00:07:23,646 --> 00:07:25,194
Ugh...

94
00:07:25,195 --> 00:07:27,292
[Special effects sound]

95
00:07:30,299 --> 00:07:32,549
Ha... I’m losing it.

96
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,923
Please give us a mission.

97
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:50,575
[Suspicious shadow]

98
00:07:51,491 --> 00:07:53,474
Ah, seriously...

99
00:07:57,082 --> 00:07:58,562
Ah, seriously...

100
00:07:58,563 --> 00:08:01,016
Isn’t this just too much?

101
00:08:01,017 --> 00:08:02,186
Ah, seriously...

102
00:08:02,701 --> 00:08:05,584
I need to find a hiding spot... somewhere to hide.

103
00:08:08,550 --> 00:08:11,525
[YEONJUN’s breathing gets heavier]

104
00:08:19,862 --> 00:08:21,707
Ugh, seriously...

105
00:08:25,697 --> 00:08:29,103
[1F / YEONJUN]

106
00:08:31,168 --> 00:08:33,014
Hey, KAI...

107
00:08:33,015 --> 00:08:33,894
KAI-YA!

108
00:08:33,895 --> 00:08:35,263
[HUENINGKAI]
Huh? What is it?

109
00:08:35,264 --> 00:08:37,280
[YEONJUN and HUENINGKAI meet on the 1st floor]

110
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,299
Oh! Hi!

111
00:08:38,301 --> 00:08:39,825
Why haven’t they sent the mission?

112
00:08:39,826 --> 00:08:41,131
You didn’t get the mission either?

113
00:08:41,133 --> 00:08:42,876
No, I’m so scared right now.

114
00:08:43,268 --> 00:08:45,023
I didn’t get one either.

115
00:08:46,448 --> 00:08:49,963
[Meanwhile, in the basement (B1)]

116
00:08:51,324 --> 00:08:54,670
[TAEHYUN still stands at the door]

117
00:09:04,107 --> 00:09:07,486
[He cautiously starts moving]

118
00:09:17,715 --> 00:09:21,675
[Checks the next room and heads upstairs]

119
00:09:29,582 --> 00:09:34,450
[1F / TAEHYUN]

120
00:09:36,906 --> 00:09:39,741
[He reunites with YEONJUN and HUENINGKAI]

121
00:09:39,987 --> 00:09:41,700
This is way too scary.

122
00:09:41,701 --> 00:09:42,991
I’m so scared.

123
00:09:43,302 --> 00:09:44,858
Didn’t we meet up a little too fast?

124
00:09:44,859 --> 00:09:46,914
– Let’s just stay together a bit.
– Yeah.

125
00:09:47,536 --> 00:09:48,705
Forget screen time or whatever.

126
00:09:48,706 --> 00:09:50,168
I just want to find the key and get out.

127
00:09:50,169 --> 00:09:51,541
I’m seriously so scared.

128
00:09:54,008 --> 00:09:55,809
Well, at least three of us are together now.

129
00:09:55,810 --> 00:09:58,401
I think we should find a hiding spot first.

130
00:10:04,803 --> 00:10:05,976
Where did you guys come from?

131
00:10:05,977 --> 00:10:07,281
– Over there.
– From the basement.

132
00:10:07,597 --> 00:10:09,907
[The three start moving to find a hiding spot]

133
00:10:09,908 --> 00:10:11,907
Hey! Look over there!

134
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:16,437
[A mannequin standing eerily still]

135
00:10:16,438 --> 00:10:18,116
I came through here. It’s way too scary.

136
00:10:18,117 --> 00:10:20,008
I can’t get a sense of the layout.

137
00:10:20,009 --> 00:10:22,473
I don’t even know where I am.

138
00:10:22,474 --> 00:10:24,301
I keep checking my phone but the mission still hasn’t come.

139
00:10:24,705 --> 00:10:30,533
[1F / YEONJUN TAEHYUN HUENINGKAI]

140
00:10:30,534 --> 00:10:32,078
[Phone notification sound]

141
00:10:32,079 --> 00:10:33,914
Oh? I think we got the mission.

142
00:10:33,915 --> 00:10:35,525
It came!

143
00:10:35,526 --> 00:10:37,970
It says to find a key in a place you absolutely don’t want to open.

144
00:10:38,470 --> 00:10:41,053
“Starting now, find a key hidden in a place you absolutely don’t want to open.

145
00:10:41,245 --> 00:10:43,255
If caught by the seeker, you can use the key to escape

146
00:10:43,256 --> 00:10:45,900
or use it to rescue another member.”

147
00:10:45,901 --> 00:10:48,174
You can use it to rescue another member too.

148
00:10:48,175 --> 00:10:49,195
That means the one you found earlier was probably a key.

149
00:10:49,196 --> 00:10:50,634
I didn’t even open the fridge yet.

150
00:10:50,635 --> 00:10:53,766
Then I guess we really have to look in places that seem creepy.

151
00:10:54,221 --> 00:10:56,270
Ugh, what do we do?

152
00:10:56,271 --> 00:10:58,682
What would be a place I absolutely don’t want to open?

153
00:11:00,435 --> 00:11:02,723
I really don’t want to open something like this.

154
00:11:04,782 --> 00:11:07,218
It’s not even about opening a scary place

155
00:11:07,219 --> 00:11:09,331
I just don’t want to do anything right now.

156
00:11:10,739 --> 00:11:13,349
There’s this blanket with what looks like blood on it.

157
00:11:13,834 --> 00:11:15,346
You open it.

158
00:11:16,567 --> 00:11:18,743
Oh, it’s not blood?

159
00:11:19,084 --> 00:11:22,954
[BEOMGYU mistakes the pattern for blood]

160
00:11:28,863 --> 00:11:31,015
BEOMGYU, can you try opening this one?

161
00:11:31,016 --> 00:11:31,630
Where?

162
00:11:31,631 --> 00:11:32,939
I can’t do it.

163
00:11:36,331 --> 00:11:39,243
[No key in the drawer either]

164
00:11:42,844 --> 00:11:44,343
Want me to move this too?

165
00:11:48,096 --> 00:11:49,993
[Sound of a window opening]

166
00:11:50,451 --> 00:11:51,773
Unless something starts moving...

167
00:11:51,774 --> 00:11:52,972
Ugh... that one.

168
00:11:52,973 --> 00:11:55,353
No, just leave it.

169
00:11:57,144 --> 00:11:59,189
I don’t think anything’s in here.

170
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:00,170
Should we go to the next room?

171
00:12:00,171 --> 00:12:01,590
Yeah!

172
00:12:02,333 --> 00:12:04,815
Was there something scary to open in there?

173
00:12:04,816 --> 00:12:07,113
– Uh... yeah, kinda.
– There was something.

174
00:12:07,114 --> 00:12:09,034
I can’t open it.

175
00:12:09,773 --> 00:12:12,020
A place you absolutely don’t want to open?

176
00:12:12,021 --> 00:12:13,375
Everything here looks like that.

177
00:12:15,370 --> 00:12:17,712
I mean, this one clearly looks like you shouldn’t open it.

178
00:12:17,713 --> 00:12:19,118
Aren’t we supposed to open this one?

179
00:12:20,643 --> 00:12:23,660
[They open the curtain]

180
00:12:23,661 --> 00:12:26,296
[But there’s nothing there]

181
00:12:27,286 --> 00:12:28,982
Sorry, I just need a second.

182
00:12:30,342 --> 00:12:31,709
Sorry.

183
00:12:31,710 --> 00:12:34,320
[Even after searching the human-shaped float...]

184
00:12:34,321 --> 00:12:36,756
[still no sign of a key]

185
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:44,190
[YEONJUN and TAEHYUN check the machine room]

186
00:12:50,505 --> 00:12:53,149
Should we just leave? There’s an exit over there.

187
00:12:53,277 --> 00:12:54,437
Let’s go! Seriously.

188
00:12:57,400 --> 00:13:00,621
[An exit door visible in the distance]

189
00:13:04,166 --> 00:13:06,185
[TAEHYUN follows YEONJUN]

190
00:13:12,205 --> 00:13:15,295
Wow, it’s locked. Seriously...

191
00:13:15,296 --> 00:13:16,847
Hey, the door’s locked.

192
00:13:17,746 --> 00:13:21,218
[You can’t leave until the game ends]

193
00:13:24,116 --> 00:13:27,515
I think we have to go upstairs.

194
00:13:27,516 --> 00:13:29,979
– We have to go up.
– But we haven’t searched this area yet.

195
00:13:29,980 --> 00:13:30,763
No, we need to go up.

196
00:13:30,764 --> 00:13:31,590
There’s nothing in places like this.

197
00:13:31,822 --> 00:13:34,419
Then let’s just check that one last spot and go.

198
00:13:34,420 --> 00:13:36,393
You’re seriously brave.

199
00:13:37,007 --> 00:13:39,778
[HUENINGKAI heads toward a spot that’s been bothering him]

200
00:13:42,445 --> 00:13:43,220
Hey!

201
00:13:43,221 --> 00:13:44,612
Hey! I found it!

202
00:13:44,816 --> 00:13:45,920
[A coffin with hair sticking out]

203
00:13:45,921 --> 00:13:46,596
Isn’t it this?

204
00:13:47,210 --> 00:13:48,514
What is it?

205
00:13:49,413 --> 00:13:50,861
I think this is it.

206
00:13:52,864 --> 00:13:54,030
Ah! That scared me!

207
00:13:55,851 --> 00:13:57,009
I think it’s the right one.

208
00:13:57,889 --> 00:14:00,254
[HUENINGKAI finds the second key]

209
00:14:00,255 --> 00:14:03,048
There was hair sticking out of it.

210
00:14:03,049 --> 00:14:05,210
Wow, you’re really good at this.

211
00:14:06,725 --> 00:14:07,774
Goodnight.

212
00:14:07,775 --> 00:14:09,521
Rest in peace.

213
00:14:09,522 --> 00:14:10,827
I’m sorry.

214
00:14:10,828 --> 00:14:12,875
Let’s leave it open so the others don’t get confused.

215
00:14:12,876 --> 00:14:14,155
Oh, should we?

216
00:14:16,668 --> 00:14:18,630
[Phone notification sound]

217
00:14:20,232 --> 00:14:21,881
Hold on, we got a message.

218
00:14:22,412 --> 00:14:24,267
[Key hint]
Is this the hint?

219
00:14:25,363 --> 00:14:26,404
One hint.

220
00:14:28,075 --> 00:14:29,257
There’s a beaker.

221
00:14:29,258 --> 00:14:30,921
A beaker sitting on something.

222
00:14:30,922 --> 00:14:32,729
It’s a desk?

223
00:14:32,730 --> 00:14:36,073
– I think we need to go upstairs.
– There was a staircase earlier.

224
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:40,574
[Phone notification sound]

225
00:14:41,267 --> 00:14:43,458
[Key hint / SOOBIN and BEOMGYU check the hint too]

226
00:14:43,459 --> 00:14:45,132
Oh? I know this place!
Oh?

227
00:14:45,133 --> 00:14:46,086
YEONJUN, let’s go up.

228
00:14:46,087 --> 00:14:46,752
Oh? We’re going here?

229
00:14:46,753 --> 00:14:47,912
Yeah!

230
00:14:48,365 --> 00:14:49,618
I was born here, you know?

231
00:14:49,619 --> 00:14:50,609
Oh? Really?

232
00:14:50,610 --> 00:14:53,967
Then was there a key in the room you started in?

233
00:14:54,744 --> 00:15:01,349
[4F / SOOBIN BEOMGYU]

234
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:02,942
Where?

235
00:15:02,943 --> 00:15:04,029
Right here.

236
00:15:05,820 --> 00:15:06,827
[Desk from the hint photo]

237
00:15:06,828 --> 00:15:09,345
Oh, we were supposed to open all of these?

238
00:15:14,492 --> 00:15:18,329
[The moment they opened the drawer]

239
00:15:19,775 --> 00:15:22,750
Putting a cockroach in there? Come on, have some decency.

240
00:15:22,751 --> 00:15:24,781
What is it?

241
00:15:24,782 --> 00:15:26,737
Stuff like that.

242
00:15:29,413 --> 00:15:32,312
If they hide things like that, I won’t be able to open anything.

243
00:15:35,117 --> 00:15:37,713
[BEOMGYU finds the third key]

244
00:15:40,739 --> 00:15:42,222
Let’s go!

245
00:15:42,223 --> 00:15:43,167
There might be something else in here.

246
00:15:43,168 --> 00:15:44,528
I found a key.

247
00:15:44,529 --> 00:15:45,876
Oh, you did?

248
00:15:46,045 --> 00:15:49,031
[While the two were finding the key from the hint]

249
00:15:49,974 --> 00:15:51,808
But if we all move together like this

250
00:15:51,809 --> 00:15:53,510
won’t we get caught at once?

251
00:15:53,511 --> 00:15:55,823
Then one of us has to sacrifice.

252
00:15:55,824 --> 00:15:58,561
One gets caught and two run away.

253
00:15:58,562 --> 00:15:59,824
If all three of us get caught

254
00:15:59,825 --> 00:16:02,129
You go! We’ll stay behind.

255
00:16:05,390 --> 00:16:06,719
[2F / YEONJUN TAEHYUN HUENINGKAI]

256
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:11,502
[The three move to the 2nd floor]

257
00:16:17,016 --> 00:16:18,389
Oh! This is great.

258
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:19,919
There’s CCTV.

259
00:16:20,506 --> 00:16:22,640
We can use this to track the seeker.

260
00:16:22,641 --> 00:16:24,605
Hey, there are two people here.

261
00:16:24,606 --> 00:16:26,515
[They spot SOOBIN and BEOMGYU on CCTV]

262
00:16:26,908 --> 00:16:28,889
Glad they’re together.

263
00:16:29,987 --> 00:16:30,883
Hey!

264
00:16:30,884 --> 00:16:32,299
It says if we watch the whole video

265
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:33,575
we can get a key.

266
00:16:33,576 --> 00:16:35,112
Really? Let’s watch!

267
00:16:35,113 --> 00:16:38,935
[“Watch the video to the end to get a key”]

268
00:16:38,936 --> 00:16:40,663
It seriously looks like something you shouldn’t watch.

269
00:16:44,257 --> 00:16:45,893
I’ll try watching it here.

270
00:16:50,041 --> 00:16:52,394
Doesn’t it feel like we’ll have to run?

271
00:16:52,395 --> 00:16:55,081
I didn’t just summon the seeker, right?

272
00:16:55,082 --> 00:16:56,659
No way... this can’t be real.

273
00:16:56,660 --> 00:16:58,347
Want to keep watching the CCTV?

274
00:16:58,348 --> 00:16:59,601
Just in case.

275
00:16:59,602 --> 00:17:02,414
[TAEHYUN keeps watch with a clenched fist]

276
00:17:03,050 --> 00:17:04,578
[The countdown numbers keep dropping]

277
00:17:04,579 --> 00:17:05,958
Or

278
00:17:05,959 --> 00:17:07,644
should someone else take the key?

279
00:17:07,645 --> 00:17:09,306
– Throw it!
– No, you keep it.

280
00:17:09,307 --> 00:17:11,685
No.

281
00:17:11,686 --> 00:17:13,339
Just in case.

282
00:17:13,701 --> 00:17:15,300
How many seconds left?

283
00:17:15,701 --> 00:17:17,163
Only 9 seconds now.

284
00:17:17,164 --> 00:17:18,819
This is way too scary.

285
00:17:19,363 --> 00:17:21,540
But I’m curious, so I feel like we have to watch.

286
00:17:37,242 --> 00:17:39,261
Fooled you?

287
00:17:41,659 --> 00:17:43,375
– It says “Just kidding.”
– It was a joke...

288
00:17:43,376 --> 00:17:45,102
Ah, it was fake!

289
00:17:45,103 --> 00:17:46,580
Seriously...

290
00:17:46,986 --> 00:17:48,974
[Phone notification sound]

291
00:17:49,412 --> 00:17:50,556
[Key hint / Basement]
It says to go to the basement.

292
00:17:50,557 --> 00:17:52,155
There’s a basement too?

293
00:17:52,156 --> 00:17:53,848
[Two of them head down to the basement]

294
00:17:53,849 --> 00:17:56,044
[They run into the others on the 2nd floor]

295
00:17:56,045 --> 00:17:58,450
Hey, the key hint says it’s in the basement.

296
00:17:58,451 --> 00:17:59,482
Let’s go to the basement!

297
00:17:59,483 --> 00:18:02,963
[YEONJUN, BEOMGYU, and TAEHYUN head to the basement]

298
00:18:02,964 --> 00:18:05,415
[SOOBIN and HUENINGKAI stay on the 2nd floor]

299
00:18:05,982 --> 00:18:07,841
Did you open all of these?

300
00:18:08,703 --> 00:18:10,247
No!

301
00:18:10,248 --> 00:18:11,959
Try opening something like this.

302
00:18:13,065 --> 00:18:14,357
BEOMGYU found one in a drawer.

303
00:18:14,358 --> 00:18:16,292
I found one in a fridge.

304
00:18:17,455 --> 00:18:20,426
[Three keys found so far]

305
00:18:20,755 --> 00:18:23,800
My heart feels like it’s about to explode.

306
00:18:23,801 --> 00:18:25,390
You’re being super bold right now.

307
00:18:25,391 --> 00:18:25,894
Nice!

308
00:18:25,895 --> 00:18:27,663
I really like seeing you so brave, YEONJUN.

309
00:18:27,664 --> 00:18:28,793
I love it.

310
00:18:28,794 --> 00:18:30,285
This is a first for me too.

311
00:18:31,411 --> 00:18:34,078
[B1 / YEONJUN BEOMGYU TAEHYUN]
I woke up in this room.

312
00:18:34,079 --> 00:18:35,866
Let’s check everything here first.

313
00:18:35,867 --> 00:18:37,116
Yeah, good idea.

314
00:18:40,809 --> 00:18:42,587
Did you check all these places?

315
00:18:42,588 --> 00:18:44,232
No, I just walked out.

316
00:18:45,476 --> 00:18:49,607
[TAEHYUN looks around where he woke up]

317
00:18:51,643 --> 00:18:53,765
[Finds a mask instead of a key]

318
00:18:53,766 --> 00:18:55,159
Let’s go!

319
00:18:56,496 --> 00:18:58,058
How is he like that?

320
00:18:58,059 --> 00:18:59,125
His courage is on another level.

321
00:18:59,126 --> 00:19:01,140
That thing scared me earlier.

322
00:19:01,670 --> 00:19:03,609
There’s nothing here. Let’s check that room.

323
00:19:04,828 --> 00:19:07,591
[They head to the next room with no luck]

324
00:19:10,368 --> 00:19:12,672
Doesn’t it feel like there’s something here?

325
00:19:20,343 --> 00:19:23,058
[BEOMGYU enters the kitchen]

326
00:19:24,937 --> 00:19:27,500
– Let’s check as we walk straight.
– Let’s check here.

327
00:19:35,891 --> 00:19:37,936
Nothing here.

328
00:19:39,183 --> 00:19:40,879
Nothing here either.

329
00:19:44,905 --> 00:19:46,593
Should we open these one by one?

330
00:19:46,594 --> 00:19:47,757
Where could it be?

331
00:19:49,027 --> 00:19:51,178
YEONJUN, should we open the cabinets one by one?

332
00:19:51,473 --> 00:19:53,404
It might be in here.

333
00:19:53,405 --> 00:19:55,166
Will it open?

334
00:19:56,045 --> 00:19:58,252
It really looks like something you shouldn’t open.

335
00:19:58,552 --> 00:20:00,950
[A strange sound is heard in the distance]

336
00:20:01,913 --> 00:20:03,451
I think the seeker just appeared.

337
00:20:03,452 --> 00:20:04,860
Hurry, open the cabinet!

338
00:20:05,203 --> 00:20:07,831
[The strange sound continues]

339
00:20:08,087 --> 00:20:12,059
[Trying to ignore it, they keep opening the cabinets]

340
00:20:19,552 --> 00:20:21,592
[YEONJUN screams]

341
00:20:25,088 --> 00:20:26,236
Found it?

342
00:20:27,027 --> 00:20:28,741
[SOOBIN screams loudly]

343
00:20:29,060 --> 00:20:30,686
– What’s happening?
– I don’t know, I just heard something.

344
00:20:30,687 --> 00:20:32,350
Ah, this is scary.

345
00:20:32,644 --> 00:20:35,298
Now I’m the seeker.

346
00:20:36,978 --> 00:20:40,961
Ready or not...

347
00:20:56,135 --> 00:20:58,224
[BEOMGYU watches the situation unfold from the kitchen]

348
00:20:58,225 --> 00:21:02,050
[B1 / BEOMGYU]

349
00:21:02,051 --> 00:21:03,496
[Hiding in a small room in the basement]

350
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:10,270
[1F / YEONJUN TAEHYUN]

351
00:21:10,271 --> 00:21:12,136
[YEONJUN and TAEHYUN head up to the 2nd floor]

352
00:21:13,526 --> 00:21:15,590
[They regroup with SOOBIN and HUENINGKAI]

353
00:21:15,591 --> 00:21:16,664
We opened something earlier

354
00:21:16,665 --> 00:21:17,758
and the seeker came out of it.

355
00:21:17,759 --> 00:21:19,690
Oh really? Where’s BEOMGYU?

356
00:21:19,691 --> 00:21:20,986
We left him behind!

357
00:21:24,616 --> 00:21:26,681
[Phone notification sound]

358
00:21:28,396 --> 00:21:30,685
“Hide-and-seek begins now.

359
00:21:30,686 --> 00:21:33,120
Game time is 4,444 seconds. If the seeker spots you, you’ll be sent to jail.

360
00:21:33,121 --> 00:21:34,745
Survival rate is key in this game. If you maintain over 50%

361
00:21:34,746 --> 00:21:36,098
you can win a big prize for MOA.

362
00:21:36,099 --> 00:21:37,824
Do your best to raise the survival rate.”

363
00:21:37,825 --> 00:21:39,340
What do I do?

364
00:21:39,341 --> 00:21:41,118
What should I do?

365
00:21:41,119 --> 00:21:42,372
Where do I hide?

366
00:21:52,542 --> 00:21:56,786
Ready or not.

367
00:21:56,787 --> 00:22:00,051
Someone might see your hair.

368
00:22:03,968 --> 00:22:07,013
But you really can hide in clever places.

369
00:22:07,701 --> 00:22:11,282
Ready or not.

370
00:22:11,283 --> 00:22:14,857
Your clothes might give you away.

371
00:22:16,266 --> 00:22:18,040
I don’t think I should stay here.

372
00:22:18,527 --> 00:22:21,465
Is everyone hidden?

373
00:22:21,466 --> 00:22:23,545
Here I come.

374
00:22:23,546 --> 00:22:29,113
[Hide-and-seek begins]

375
00:22:29,114 --> 00:22:30,013
[3F / YEONJUN TAEHYUN]

376
00:22:30,014 --> 00:22:31,956
How was the seeker exactly there?

377
00:22:31,957 --> 00:22:33,417
We were dead-on.

378
00:22:42,461 --> 00:22:43,596
I hate this so much.

379
00:22:43,597 --> 00:22:44,453
What are we supposed to do?

380
00:22:44,454 --> 00:22:46,900
I seriously can’t do anything right now.

381
00:22:49,836 --> 00:22:51,821
Stay here then.

382
00:22:53,012 --> 00:22:55,879
Okay, I’ll watch the rear. I’m watching the rear.

383
00:22:57,945 --> 00:22:59,733
The seeker’s not here for now.

384
00:23:00,863 --> 00:23:02,653
[YEONJUN sighs]

385
00:23:03,995 --> 00:23:07,419
[4F / SOOBIN / SOOBIN alone on the 4th floor]

386
00:23:09,786 --> 00:23:12,168
There’s nowhere to hide.

387
00:23:18,563 --> 00:23:20,144
[B1 / Basement]

388
00:23:20,145 --> 00:23:21,922
[B1 / BEOMGYU / Seeker]

389
00:23:21,923 --> 00:23:24,679
[BEOMGYU]

390
00:23:27,999 --> 00:23:31,606
[BEOMGYU is with the seeker]

391
00:23:37,161 --> 00:23:40,861
[B1 / BEOMGYU / Seeker]

392
00:23:40,862 --> 00:23:44,965
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

393
00:23:44,966 --> 00:23:48,536
[BEOMGYU]

394
00:23:56,480 --> 00:24:00,417
[Seeker heads to 1F without entering the room]

395
00:24:05,793 --> 00:24:09,306
[HUENINGKAI hides inside a coffin on 1F]

396
00:24:09,307 --> 00:24:14,730
[HUENINGKAI]

397
00:24:15,069 --> 00:24:17,113
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

398
00:24:19,293 --> 00:24:21,694
The seeker’s coming.

399
00:24:23,969 --> 00:24:25,344
[1F / HUENINGKAI]

400
00:24:25,345 --> 00:24:31,551
[1F / Seeker / HUENINGKAI]

401
00:24:39,128 --> 00:24:44,983
[HUENINGKAI]

402
00:24:44,984 --> 00:24:47,371
[Seeker walks past without noticing]

403
00:24:51,142 --> 00:24:52,538
Ha...

404
00:24:52,539 --> 00:24:54,905
What do I do? I can’t do anything.

405
00:24:55,993 --> 00:24:58,938
[YEONJUN and TAEHYUN on the stairs between 2F and 3F]

406
00:25:00,295 --> 00:25:03,092
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

407
00:25:23,945 --> 00:25:26,930
[SOOBIN]

408
00:25:28,029 --> 00:25:31,143
[Seeker]

409
00:25:31,663 --> 00:25:33,167
What? What? What?

410
00:25:33,168 --> 00:25:33,859
Is the seeker there?

411
00:25:33,860 --> 00:25:34,770
Run!

412
00:25:34,771 --> 00:25:35,405
Run! Run!

413
00:25:36,016 --> 00:25:39,424
[They head down using the opposite stairs]

414
00:25:48,407 --> 00:25:51,692
[1F / SOOBIN YEONJUN TAEHYUN / HUENINGKAI]

415
00:25:51,933 --> 00:25:54,090
Why are you all following me?

416
00:25:54,091 --> 00:25:55,861
Spread out a bit. Why are you following me?

417
00:25:56,263 --> 00:25:57,791
I seriously

418
00:25:57,792 --> 00:25:59,289
don’t want to be alone.

419
00:26:02,932 --> 00:26:06,336
[B1 / BEOMGYU / Alone in the basement]

420
00:26:07,159 --> 00:26:09,474
Ah, the seeker already left this area.

421
00:26:13,783 --> 00:26:15,297
Huh?

422
00:26:15,298 --> 00:26:16,792
A key!

423
00:26:20,745 --> 00:26:24,324
[BEOMGYU finds the fourth key]

424
00:26:24,676 --> 00:26:27,028
[Back to the 1st floor]

425
00:26:27,325 --> 00:26:29,951
[HUENINGKAI]

426
00:26:38,134 --> 00:26:40,547
This is where I woke up.

427
00:26:40,548 --> 00:26:42,007
Where I woke up.

428
00:26:42,008 --> 00:26:42,904
Here?

429
00:26:42,905 --> 00:26:45,454
I think we’ll get caught here.

430
00:26:45,455 --> 00:26:46,724
Why are you following me?

431
00:26:46,725 --> 00:26:48,366
Please spread out.

432
00:26:48,367 --> 00:26:50,843
Wow, why is this so scary?

433
00:26:56,668 --> 00:26:58,743
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

434
00:26:58,946 --> 00:27:00,411
[Members]

435
00:27:00,412 --> 00:27:01,742
[Seeker]

436
00:27:01,743 --> 00:27:04,555
[The seeker appears on the 1st floor]

437
00:27:10,417 --> 00:27:14,706
[Members]

438
00:27:14,707 --> 00:27:15,207
[TAEHYUN]

439
00:27:15,208 --> 00:27:17,003
[YEONJUN]

440
00:27:24,426 --> 00:27:25,690
[Seeker]

441
00:27:25,691 --> 00:27:28,138
[TAEHYUN / Seeker]

442
00:27:35,344 --> 00:27:37,890
[TAEHYUN]

443
00:27:39,390 --> 00:27:40,915
[TAEHYUN]

444
00:27:40,916 --> 00:27:42,341
[The seeker spots TAEHYUN]

445
00:27:45,629 --> 00:27:47,740
[TAEHYUN]

446
00:27:47,741 --> 00:27:48,885
[Seeker]

447
00:27:51,465 --> 00:27:52,954
[Seeker]

448
00:27:53,599 --> 00:27:56,596
[He tries to run away quickly]

449
00:27:59,093 --> 00:28:00,522
Got you! TAEHYUN.

450
00:28:06,081 --> 00:28:06,732
[YEONJUN / SOOBIN / BEOMGYU / TAEHYUN / HUENINGKAI]

451
00:28:06,733 --> 00:28:09,332
[TAEHYUN]

452
00:28:19,054 --> 00:28:21,780
SOOBIN, if we’re going, we have to go now.

453
00:28:21,781 --> 00:28:22,600
Let’s go!

454
00:28:22,601 --> 00:28:24,168
Ugh, this is seriously terrifying.

455
00:28:24,169 --> 00:28:25,246
– Is the seeker gone?
– Gone.

456
00:28:25,247 --> 00:28:26,914
[Phone notification sound]

457
00:28:29,996 --> 00:28:32,248
[“One member has been caught”]
It says one member’s been caught.

458
00:28:32,578 --> 00:28:34,727
Looked like it was TAEHYUN...

459
00:28:36,991 --> 00:28:38,377
Oh, is this the jail?

460
00:28:38,378 --> 00:28:41,647
[Jail located outside the building]

461
00:28:43,741 --> 00:28:45,336
It’s really come to this...

462
00:28:51,701 --> 00:28:54,401
[If you don’t escape within 20 minutes]

463
00:28:54,402 --> 00:28:57,504
[you’re trapped until the end of the game]

464
00:29:01,799 --> 00:29:05,828
[B1 / BEOMGYU]
Yes, I’m currently in enemy territory.

465
00:29:08,867 --> 00:29:10,736
Ugh... my head...

466
00:29:12,999 --> 00:29:14,951
I’m the seeker!

467
00:29:19,283 --> 00:29:20,187
[1F / SOOBIN YEONJUN / HUENINGKAI / Seeker]

468
00:29:20,188 --> 00:29:21,625
[The seeker is still on the 1st floor]

469
00:29:24,220 --> 00:29:27,530
[HUENINGKAI / YEONJUN & SOOBIN]

470
00:29:29,477 --> 00:29:31,238
They’re really searching hard.

471
00:29:33,445 --> 00:29:35,091
[YEONJUN makes a sound]

472
00:29:37,884 --> 00:29:38,854
[YEONJUN]

473
00:29:38,855 --> 00:29:41,118
[Seeker]

474
00:29:41,119 --> 00:29:42,156
[YEONJUN]

475
00:29:42,157 --> 00:29:44,225
[The seeker spots YEONJUN]

476
00:29:44,586 --> 00:29:46,026
[YEONJUN screams]

477
00:29:58,532 --> 00:30:00,026
YEONJUN...

478
00:30:01,869 --> 00:30:04,380
I shouldn’t laugh.

479
00:30:05,098 --> 00:30:06,804
[1F / HUENINGKAI / SOOBIN / YEONJUN / Seeker]

480
00:30:06,805 --> 00:30:08,278
[He evades the seeker and returns to his spot]

481
00:30:08,279 --> 00:30:12,044
[YEONJUN]

482
00:30:18,829 --> 00:30:20,786
Ugh, seriously...

483
00:30:21,479 --> 00:30:23,571
[YEONJUN breathing heavily]

484
00:30:23,572 --> 00:30:26,416
I really want to stop now.

485
00:30:33,671 --> 00:30:35,496
[Sound of the seeker’s cane]

486
00:30:40,625 --> 00:30:43,399
[SOOBIN / YEONJUN]

487
00:30:51,662 --> 00:30:55,573
[The seeker circles around the members]

488
00:31:15,053 --> 00:31:17,679
Ha... this is way too scary.

489
00:31:24,214 --> 00:31:27,785
[SOOBIN / YEONJUN]

490
00:31:32,498 --> 00:31:39,060
[SOOBIN]
